# Agent-authored, append-only logs. Parallel lanes only add new dated entries, so
# concatenating both sides is always the correct merge and Git resolves it without
# a conflict. Never list a file here that agents edit in place: union merge would
# silently keep both versions of a rewritten line.
docs/reference/history/requirements-log.txt merge=union
